{"step_index":593,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-29T23:53:44Z","content":"I have analyzed **`RLCF Praise Live — July 19, 2026.mp4`**, transcribed the audio, identified all **5 worship songs** along with each speaking and prayer segment, and created the 1-click DaVinci Resolve scripts for you.\n\n---\n\n### 🎵 Identified Songs in the File\n\n| # | Song Title | Start Time | End Time | Duration | Lyrics / Key Themes |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| **1** | **What a Faithful God Have I** | `02:11` | `05:19` | 3m 08s | *\"Lord I come before Your throne of grace... What a faithful God have I...\"* |\n| **2** | **Why So Downcast, O My Soul** | `06:14` | `08:09` | 1m 55s | *\"Why so downcast O my soul, put your hope in God... Bless the Lord O my soul... He's the lifter of my countenance...\"* |\n| **3** | **Burn, Fire of God!** *(My Ransomed Soul Possessing)* | `20:48` | `24:56` | 4m 08s | *\"Burn, fire of God, my ransomed soul possessing... Touch with live coal from off Thy sacred altar... Pure fire of God...\"* |\n| **4** | **Christ Is Mine Forevermore** | `26:43` | `30:37` | 3m 54s | *\"Mine are days that God has numbered... Mine are tears in times of sorrow... Pilgrim on the narrow way... Christ is mine forevermore!\"* |\n| **5** | **Footprints of Jesus** *(Sweetly, Lord, Have We Heard Thee Calling)* | `30:37` | `35:26` | 4m 49s | *\"Sweetly Lord have we heard Thee calling, 'Come, follow Me!'... Footprints of Jesus that make the pathway glow...\"* |\n\n---\n\n### 🎬 Complete Timeline Breakdown (Full Service)\n\nEvery section is cut with sub-second accuracy to preserve full musical introductions and natural reverb decay:\n\n| Clip | Section Name | Type | Start Timecode | End Timecode | Color Code |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | **Opening Spoken Prayer** | Spoken | `00:00:00:00` | `00:02:11:00` | **Orange** |\n| 2 | **1. What a Faithful God Have I** | **Song** | `00:02:11:00` | `00:05:19:03` | **Teal** |\n| 3 | **Sharing: Encourage Yourself in the Lord** | Spoken | `00:05:19:03` | `00:06:14:15` | **Orange** |\n| 4 | **2. Why So Downcast, O My Soul** | **Song** | `00:06:14:15` | `00:08:09:15` | **Teal** |\n| 5 | **Prayer & Consecration at the Altar** | Spoken | `00:08:09:15` | `00:20:48:00` | **Orange** |\n| 6 | **3. Burn, Fire of God!** | **Song** | `00:20:48:00` | `00:24:56:00` | **Teal** |\n| 7 | **Sharing: Christ Our True Treasure** | Spoken | `00:24:56:00` | `00:26:43:15` | **Orange** |\n| 8 | **4. Christ Is Mine Forevermore** | **Song** | `00:26:43:15` | `00:30:37:15` | **Teal** |\n| 9 | **5. Footprints of Jesus** | **Song** | `00:30:37:15` | `00:35:26:10` | **Teal** |\n\n---\n\n### ⚡ How to Create the Timelines in DaVinci Resolve (1-Click)\n\nI have generated and installed **two** scripts directly into DaVinci Resolve:\n\n1. **`Section_July19_Praise_Songs.lua`**: Sections off all 5 songs and preserves all spoken sharings in between (color-coded **Teal** for songs, **Orange** for speaking, with **Cyan** markers on each song).\n2. **`Create_July19_Songs_Only.lua`**: Stitches only the 5 songs seamlessly back-to-back (removes all speaking and prayers, resulting in a ~17:53 continuous worship set).\n\n#### Steps to Run:\n1. Open **DaVinci Resolve** and make sure `RLCF Praise Live — July 19, 2026.mp4` is imported into your **Media Pool**.\n2. Go to the top menu bar:\n   **Workspace** $\\rightarrow$ **Scripts** $\\rightarrow$ **Edit**\n3. Click either:\n   - **`Section_July19_Praise_Songs`** (for the full sectioned praise set)\n   - **`Create_July19_Songs_Only`** (for songs only)\n\nYour new timeline will be generated instantly with markers and color tags applied.\n\n---\n\n### 📋 YouTube Video Description Timestamps\n\n#### Option A: Full Recording Chapters (Songs & Spoken Sharings)\n```text\n00:00 Opening Prayer\n02:11 What a Faithful God Have I\n05:19 Sharing: Encourage Yourself in the Lord\n06:14 Why So Downcast, O My Soul\n08:09 Prayer & Consecration at the Altar\n20:48 Burn, Fire of God! (My Ransomed Soul Possessing)\n24:56 Sharing: Christ Our True Treasure\n26:43 Christ Is Mine Forevermore\n30:37 Footprints of Jesus (Sweetly, Lord, Have We Heard Thee Calling)\n```\n\n#### Option B: Songs Only Timeline\n```text\n00:00 What a Faithful God Have I\n03:08 Why So Downcast, O My Soul\n05:03 Burn, Fire of God! (My Ransomed Soul Possessing)\n09:11 Christ Is Mine Forevermore\n13:05 Footprints of Jesus (Sweetly, Lord, Have We Heard Thee Calling)\n```\n\n---\n\n### ☁️ Cloud & GitHub Backup Status\n- Both scripts have been copied to your local OneDrive sync folder:\n  `C:\\Users\\djtwo\\OneDrive\\RLCF-Video-Automation-Backup\\`\n- Both scripts have been committed and pushed to your private GitHub repository:\n  [`https://github.com/davelane26/rlcf-video-automation`](https://github.com/davelane26/rlcf-video-automation)"}
