{"step_index":604,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-05T00:18:15Z","content":"Created At: 2026-10-04T18:18:15-06:00\nCompleted At: 2026-10-04T18:18:15-06:00\nFile Path: `file:///C:/Users/djtwo/OneDrive/RLCF-Video-Automation-Backup/README.md`\nTotal Lines: 29\nTotal Bytes: 1677\nShowing lines 1 to 29\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n1: # RLCF Sunday Livestream Video Automation\n2: \n3: Automated video analysis, timeline generation, and YouTube chapter creation for River of Life Christian Fellowship (RLCF) Sunday livestream recordings in **DaVinci Resolve**.\n4: \n5: ---\n6: \n7: ## Features\n8: - **Singing & Worship Detection**: Automatically identifies the worship portion of the meeting, cuts out pre-service holding screens and sermons, and preserves all songs and interstitial prayers.\n9: - **Section by Song**: Slices the worship block into individual clips for each song and speaking segment.\n10: - **Color-Coded & Marked**: Color-codes song clips in **Teal** and speaking in **Orange**, and drops **Cyan** markers with the official hymn names.\n11: - **YouTube Chapters**: Generates clickable YouTube video description chapter timestamps.\n12: - **1-Click DaVinci Resolve Integration**: Native Lua scripts placed directly in Resolve's `Workspace -> Scripts -> Edit` menu.\n13: \n14: ---\n15: \n16: ## 1-Click Restore on a New PC\n17: If you switch to a new computer or reinstall Windows:\n18: 1. Clone this repository (or download the ZIP).\n19: 2. Double-click `Install_On_New_PC.bat`.\n20: 3. Open DaVinci Resolve and your scripts will be ready under `Workspace -> Scripts -> Edit`!\n21: \n22: ---\n23: \n24: ## Included Scripts\n25: - `Resolve_Scripts/Section_Each_Song_Timeline.lua`: Creates timeline sectioned into each individual song with markers and color tags.\n26: - `Resolve_Scripts/Create_Singing_Timeline.lua`: Creates a single continuous timeline of the full singing session (`00:06:18` to `00:36:13`).\n27: - `Resolve_Scripts/Create_No_Singing_Timeline.lua`: Cuts out singing and keeps only the sermon and spoken portions.\n28: - `Antigravity_Skill/SKILL.md`: The AI workflow memory and rules for Antigravity.\n29: \nThe above content shows the entire, complete file contents of the requested file.\n"}
